{
  "slug": "code-review",
  "name": "Code Review",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automated code review for pull requests using multiple specialized agents with confidence-based scoring to filter false positives",
  "longDescription": "Adds a `/code-review` command that dispatches **5 parallel agents**:\n\n- `CLAUDE.md` compliance\n- Bug detection\n- Git-blame historical context\n- Prior PR pattern matching\n- Code comment compliance\n\nEach agent scores findings on a 0-100 confidence scale, and only issues scoring 80+ are included in the final PR comment to reduce noise.",
